  "method": "Actual planAutonomousRoute421430 default closure, no reached-handler overrides and no original process. Installed Redux GFXM copies preserve authored nonempty route groups, XYZ, flags, packed links, direction and endpoint/cyclic bytes; only group point pointers relocate and runtime pack/progression table pointers publish the mapped table. Six declared synthetic skill/speed/policy/session profiles sample every nonempty group at first/middle/last points. Synthetic runtime/model/body/registry constructors come from createConnectedPlannerFixture, with positions/route associations remapped to actual data. Five populated profiles supply six racers,36 registered bodies,four model-plane obstacles,12 pickup/object/marker associations andfour constructed events; the sparse baseline is explicit. Body/obstacle sampling, costs, modifiers, builder and final selection all use actual source defaults. Every scenario checks immutable mapped bytes, unchanged physical position/velocity and native strict-score/tie/fallback selection; ordinary outputs reference exact installed authored point bytes, special outputs equal the selected candidate target slot. This is authored-data/synthetic-world integration, not captured input,constructor recovery,physics,complete races or behavioral equivalence observed in the executable.",
